    {
      "text": "The base of volcanoes is where they make their homes. They shoot fire from their five horns to repel attacking enemies.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "When battling opponents, it sprays fire from its five horns. The max temperature of the flames can reach nearly 5,500 degrees Fahrenheit.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "It protects itself with flame. Long years ago, people believed Larvesta had a nest on the sun.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "The people of ancient times believed that Larvesta fell from the sun.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "Larvesta’s body is warm all over. It spouts fire from the tips of its horns to intimidate predators and scare prey.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
